 "_terms": "The 节气's pictures (atmos.js stageArt, tier `term`): from a 节气's day until the next, the stage's picture for an outdoor scene at a place with no painting of its own. Painted 2026-10-15 by tools/paint-jieqi.py (its KEPT table holds each slot's seed).",
